cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NVCR, please cite the v1.0.7 software release using these metadata."
title: "NVCR: An extensible native runtime for deploying neural video codecs"
abstract: >-
  NVCR provides an extensible native C++ runtime for deploying neural video
  codecs, including stateful sessions, codec-adapter and execution-provider
  interfaces, target-qualified artifact selection, and bounded access units.
  Its sole production integration is DCVC-RT with TensorRT FP16 on NVIDIA
  hardware.
